  "_comment": [
    "Declarative model list for the komi-kun upscale model release.",
    "Every entry maps one `UpscaleModelCatalog` entry (catalogId, in :core:upscale) to the upstream",
    "MangaJaNai 3.0.0-onnx release zip that ships it and the exact member name inside that zip.",
    "`memberName` IS the release asset name: the catalog's `UpscaleModel.fileName` must equal it, so",
    "the app downloads the same bytes under the name it already looks for. Tools/upscale-models's",
    "README documents the rename policy (none) and the licence boundary (CC BY-NC 4.0, not GPL).",
    "Run `fetch_and_publish.py` after editing this file; `dist/manifest.json` is regenerated from it."
